    "detailed_description": "Nyanzou is hungry after playing a lot today.<br />\r\nI came home to eat dinner.<br />\r\nHowever, dinner was robbed by the &quot;&quot;Dinner Stealers&quot;&quot; who are planning to conquer the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo Nyanzou! Stop the ambitions of the &quot;&quot;Dinner Stealers&quot;&quot; and eat dinner!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Risk your life to get your dinner back&quot; is a simple jump action consisting of 3 stages.<br />\r\nOvercome enemies and traps by jumping and defeat bosses.<br />\r\nHowever, Nyanzou will continue to accelerate while pressing the movement button.<br />\r\nThere is no speed limit and speeds can reach hundreds of kilometers per hour.",
